Nethack : A few friends of mine told me about it, I knew it by "urban
legend" and decide to give it a try 1,5 years ago. notice that those
friends still haven't ascend :-)

Early playstyle : elven rangers (wanted to play elf). Not very successful.
Friends told me about how to use altar for buc-iding, for example. I guess
I was not really a discover-yourself guy... I learnt quite quickly not to
read/drink id stuff but still drink from fountains a lot. I also use to
leave my pet wheneve it was not close at the time I wanted to go down.

First spoiler : google "nethack spoiler" after about 3 months of play (I
hadn't read the Guidebook either, by the way...) Hit steelypics (or
whatever the name is), bookmarked it and soon follow links to Eva's page.

Middle playstyle : neutral monks. I liked the "on't care about
weapon/armor" stuff in the early game. I start drinking from fountain from
XL5 onward (where I can deal demons and snake) for the potential gain
ability effect. Never summoned the big D.

Read the spoilers many time and, of course, did not understand lot of
them. Played a "Minetown-first" style and seldom reach Oracle.

Pause : some change of configuration (numpad option somehow gone) make me
stop for about 6 months. Plus I had a PhD to write...

Back to the game : 9 months ago. Neutral monks ago.

RGRN : mentionned in the spoilers, came here to see. I think my first post
here was for some question during my...

First ascension : April 05. First game past Soko, too. Rather lucky (of
course) (only source of MR was quest artefact...) Neutral monk wielding
Mojo and, iirc, a nice early bonefile.

After : tried Slash'em and stick to it. Bring a Nethack Valk to the plane
of Fire (awfull ascension run with double trouble in one of the lair, lose
of all my weapons (Mojo, silver saber, had to fight bare-handed a bit)
plus Mindflayers troubles), died in Lava (didn't know I could pray to get
out of it, tried unsuccessfully to put on levitation items). Finally
ascend a slash'em doppelganger monk in July.

Currently : playing random Slah'em character. Usually not very successful
(Minetown/Mall/Soko). But my current doppelganger necromancer is virtually
ascended (done everything up to Medusa, have amulet of unchanging and walk
as a crystal golem with regeneration...) I'm pondering wether I'll try
